#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_House2/scripts.inc:54
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_House2_Text_SisterMailsBoyfriendInFortree"
msgid ""
"My little sister exchanges MAIL with\n"
"her boyfriend in FORTREE.\p"
"I don't envy her one bit at all.$"
msgstr ""
"我妹妹和她在茵郁市的男朋友\n"
"互相寄邮件。\p"
"我一点都不羡慕她。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_House2/scripts.inc:59
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_House2_Text_PokemonCarriesMailBackAndForth"
msgid ""
"Even though I can't see my friend in\n"
"FORTREE, my POKéMON carries MAIL\l"
"back and forth for us.\p"
"I'm not lonesome, even though we're\n"
"apart.$"
msgstr ""
"虽然见不到在茵郁市的朋友，\n"
"但我的宝可梦会帮我们\l"
"来回传递邮件。\p"
"所以虽然相隔两地，\n"
"我也不觉得寂寞。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_House2/scripts.inc:66
